    "title": "Macy's to close Oklahoma fulfillment center - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kelly Stroh ,\n1 days ago Macy’s plans to close a fulfillment center in Tulsa, Oklahoma, this spring, a company spokesperson told sister publication Supply Chain Dive in an email. “After careful consideration, we’ve made the decision to close our supply chain facility in Tulsa as part of our ongoing work to modernize our supply chain to better serve customers, while simplifying how we operate,” the spokesperson said. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 5",
